  "weekly_summary": {
    "week": "2026-W47",
    "items": [
      {
        "order": 1,
        "text": {
          "zh": "纯铁环境依旧变化不大。本周终于有一套八强的探子使用了TRK新牌：[[card:Photosynthetic Physician|光合医师]]（deck:4d7159dfbcd96ba3b079）。可以用绿色从坟场1费造一个生物喂给[[card:Dread Return|颤栗再现]]，和套牌思路有一定配合。不过现在基本是在守军Ramp框架下挂探子，需要这个生物的情况并不算太多，所以这张牌的应用也并不流行。",
          "en": "Pauper's metagame has changed very little. This week, a Spy Combo list finally brought a new TRK card, [[card:Photosynthetic Physician|Photosynthetic Physician]], to the Top 8 (deck:4d7159dfbcd96ba3b079). The Physician can be used from the graveyard to create a creature for a single green mana, providing fodder for [[card:Dread Return|Dread Return]]. That fits the deck's plan, but most current lists add Spy to a defender ramp shell, where the extra creature is not needed very often. As a result, the card has not become popular."
        },
